<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sport-Haley rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sport-Haley rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth analyst Diane Daggatt said Tuesday she began coverage of Sport-Haley Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Sport-Haley designs and makes men's and women's fashion golf apparel, outerwear and headwear.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/8 at 15.</p>
<p>-- Daggatt said she estimates fiscal 1997 earnings at $0.90 a share, up from $0.66 a year ago, and fiscal 1998 earnings at $1.20.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
